// planners trusting the scan; nothing persistent is written (Core registry, participation, Phase sets, origin / interval / inverse index, ring,
// pending pool, scalars). Then the apply set: a changed component is pending when one of its old Cores has a Side in
// ActiveTouch (B13 unit), else applied; applied Candidates = the changedTargets rows of applied components (an unchanged
// component is never planned for apply); the applied Merge target / SPLIT_LOCAL row of each applied Candidate (at most one
// Touch source each); the consumed READY pending parents (old Cores of applied components still pending in the planned
